<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Successful</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: #f6f8fb;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #172033;
        }

        .card {
            width: min(92%, 480px);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 48px 42px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.10);
        }

        .icon {
            width: 82px;
            height: 82px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #e9f9f0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .check {
            width: 32px;
            height: 18px;
            border-left: 4px solid #18a957;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #18a957;
            transform: rotate(-45deg);
            margin-top: -7px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: -0.7px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #697386;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .status {
            background: #f7f9fc;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            color: #4d586b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

            .status strong {
                display: block;
                color: #172033;
                font-size: 15px;
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }

        .button {
            display: block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #172033;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 22px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

            .button:hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.18);
            }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #9aa3b2;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <main class="card">

        <div class="icon">
            <div class="check"></div>
        </div>

        <h1>Payment Successful</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Thank you for your purchase. Your payment has been successfully completed.
        </p>

        <div class="status">
            <strong>Order confirmed</strong>
            We're processing your order now. You'll receive further details shortly.
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="button">
            Return to Store
        </a>

        <p class="footer">
            Your transaction has been securely processed.
        </p>

    </main>

</body>
</html>